Yes, you're right. I think the reason I got confused is the following.
Let's say my primary weapon skill is unskilled while my two-weapon
skill is basic. The spoiler says it will go with the lower skill. This
led me to believe that it will use the modifiers from what is *in
fact* the lower skill, that is, my primary weapon skill. But it won't.
Rather, it will use the modifiers from that lower skill level *as read
from the two-weapon chart*. And it's *that* switcheroo that threw me
off.

So, when two-weaponing, the modifiers are always read from the
two-weapon chart. But *which* skill level that is read from the
two-weapon chart may be determined by my primary weapon skill (if it's
lower).

